## Lottery Ticket Examine Messages
wf-lottery-ticket-examine-unscratched = This lottery ticket hasn't been scratched yet. Activate it to reveal your prize!
wf-lottery-ticket-examine-winner = This is a winning ticket worth {$amount} credits!
wf-lottery-ticket-examine-loser = This ticket didn't win anything. Better luck next time!

## Lottery Ticket Scratch Messages
wf-lottery-ticket-scratch-winner = Congratulations! You won {$amount} credits!
wf-lottery-ticket-scratch-loser = Sorry, this ticket didn't win. Try again!
wf-lottery-ticket-already-scratched = This ticket has already been scratched.
